    "fragmentShader": "precision mediump float;\nuniform sampler2D uMainSampler;\nuniform float uTime;\nvarying vec2 outTexCoord;\nvoid main(){vec4 c=texture2D(uMainSampler,outTexCoord);float f=0.5+0.5*sin((outTexCoord.x+outTexCoord.y)*6.379+uTime*0.346);gl_FragColor=vec4(c.rgb*(0.82+f*0.18),c.a);}",
